11
00:01:31,157 --> 00:01:37,687
My colors ... they transcend me into darkness .

12
00:01:37,797 --> 00:01:43,326
My colors take me so far away ... so far ...

13
00:01:43,436 --> 00:01:53,311
My colors ... they flow through my veins ...

14
