The pastor of the church is in charge of the painting .

50
00:06:12,705 --> 00:06:14,866
He 's got the say there .

51
00:06:14,974 --> 00:06:18,910
That 's where Legnani started it .

52
00:06:19,011 --> 00:06:20,103
And we can 't move it , can we ?

53
