Unhappy , there is nothing to do here except drink .

263
00:23:56,101 --> 00:23:58,228
the young women all left .

264
00:23:58,336 --> 00:24:00,167
Your friend was alone , very alone .

265
00:24:00,272 --> 00:24:05,005
In any case we sent the body to Ferrara for an Autopsy .

266
00:24:12,617 --> 00:24:14,847
Good evening . Good evening .

267
00:24:16,421 --> 00:24:18,412
Hello ?

268
00:24:18,523 --> 00:24:21,890
Yes Sir , it 's for you .

