00:24:32,604 --> 00:24:34,538
Hello ?

270
00:24:34,639 --> 00:24:38,871
Go away .

271
00:24:38,977 --> 00:24:44,005
Leave the painting alone .

272
00:24:44,115 --> 00:24:46,276
If you 're trying to scare me with phone calls ...

273
00:24:46,384 --> 00:24:49,410
you 're not going to .

274
00:24:49,521 --> 00:24:51,853
He loves me .

275
00:24:51,957 --> 00:24:54,255
I 'm not leaving , understand ?

276
00:25:16,348 --> 00:25:21,615
Excuse me , sir , one of our best clients

277
00:25:21,720 --> 00:25:24,689
from out of town arrives tomorrow morning .

278
00:25:24,789 --> 00:25:26,723
You 'll understand right ?

279
00:25:26,825 --> 00:25:28,292
What are you saying ?

280
00:25:28,393 --> 00:25:32,352
This man came to the hotel , there was no room for him .

281
00:25:32,464 --> 00:25:37,128
So we gave him yours , we are very sorry , sir .

282
00:25:39,304 --> 00:25:43,536
Do you like it ?

283
00:25:43,642 --> 00:25:48,978
I still have some left from my fishing trip .

284
00:25:49,080 --> 00:25:53,107
Want some ? They cook rats here .

285
00:25:53,218 --> 00:25:56,779
You know , there are lots more around .

286
00:25:56,888 --> 00:25:59,379
There best when boiled and still nice and hot .

287
00:26:01,760 --> 00:26:03,523
What 's inside that box ?

288
00:26:03,628 --> 00:26:07,029
What ? A secret .

289
00:26:09,367 --> 00:26:11,562
Hey ! Let 's go !

290
00:26:25,083 --> 00:26:27,517
Are we going or what ?

291
00:26:33,224 --> 00:26:33,747
Hurry up !

292
00:26:37,462 --> 00:26:45,426
It is spring and I am riding on a bike ...

293
00:26:45,537 --> 00:26:48,973
the daughter of a scooter and a whore ...

294
00:26:49,074 --> 00:26:52,908
killing hundred little bugs , as I pedal , merrily ...

295
00:26:56,615 --> 00:26:59,015
What do you think ? Not bad ?

296
00:27:05,423 --> 00:27:07,050
Are you coming or not ?

297
00:27:12,664 --> 00:27:14,188
Hurry up !

298
00:27:28,847 --> 00:27:30,712
You see , beautiful .

299
00:27:30,815 --> 00:27:33,409
If you stay here you can do what you want .

300
00:27:59,344 --> 00:28:01,039
Come on .

301
00:28:19,397 --> 00:28:20,591
Here you go .

302
00:28:29,674 --> 00:28:31,699
Who does it belong to ?

303
00:28:31,810 --> 00:28:32,902
That 's not important .

304
00:28:33,011 --> 00:28:34,308
You 'll see .

305
00:28:39,217 --> 00:28:41,378
Come here .

306
00:29:00,739 --> 00:29:02,229
This way .

307
00:29:25,230 --> 00:29:29,462
It 's you ?

308
00:29:29,567 --> 00:29:31,364
How come you didn 't eat ?

309
00:29:31,469 --> 00:29:33,562
It 's all poisoned , you snake !

310
00:29:33,671 --> 00:29:35,571
What did you do with the money I gave you ?

311
00:29:35,673 --> 00:29:39,268
Thief !

312
00:29:39,377 --> 00:29:42,904
If you don 't like what I bring , walk to a restaurant .

313
00:29:45,283 --> 00:29:51,188
If I could only get up from this bed !

314
00:29:54,092 --> 00:29:56,185
Who is this ?

315
00:29:56,294 --> 00:29:58,228
Good morning .

316
00:29:58,329 --> 00:29:59,762
He 's a kind man .

317
00:29:59,864 --> 00:30:05,825
He 's gonna stay here a while until he finds a place .

318
00:30:05,937 --> 00:30:09,805
It 's been a long time since I was visited by someone .

319
00:30:09,908 --> 00:30:11,933
I am all by my self here .

320
00:30:12,043 --> 00:30:16,207
The silence is unbearable .

321
00:30:25,423 --> 00:30:27,118
Where is the man who took my room ?

322
00:30:27,225 --> 00:30:28,089
Who do you mean ?

323
00:30:28,193 --> 00:30:29,820
The new client .

324
00:30:29,928 --> 00:30:31,395
There is no one .

325
00:30:31,496 --> 00:30:34,329
The last tourist I saw here was a Nazi in the 40 's !

326
00:32:09,193 --> 00:32:11,559
Who is it ?

327
00:32:11,663 --> 00:32:12,960
Ah , it 's you .

328
00:32:13,064 --> 00:32:14,554
I didn 't want to disturb you .

329
00:32:14,666 --> 00:32:16,327
I thought you were sleeping .

330
00:32:16,434 --> 00:32:18,902
Sleep ? Me ? Not quite .

331
00:32:19,003 --> 00:32:22,268
How can a woman in so much pain sleep ?

332
00:32:22,373 --> 00:32:23,965
Can I ask you a question ?

333
00:32:24,075 --> 00:32:25,667
Do you hear noises at night ?

334
00:32:25,777 --> 00:32:27,301
Noises ?

335
00:32:27,412 --> 00:32:29,175
Yes . Last night ?

336
00:32:29,280 --> 00:32:31,544
Yes .

337
00:32:31,649 --> 00:32:33,082
Noises !

338
00:32:33,184 --> 00:32:35,482
The only person you could bump into here is me

339
00:32:35,586 --> 00:32:39,886
and I 'm not in that good of shape to be walking around .

340
00:32:39,991 --> 00:32:44,018
I don 't think you 're in that bad of shape .

341
00:32:44,128 --> 00:32:47,564
Come , young man .

342
00:32:47,665 --> 00:32:50,156
Come next to me .

343
00:32:50,268 --> 00:32:55,604
It 's been a long time since I 've talked with anyone sane .

344
00:32:55,707 --> 00:33:00,440
It makes me happy that someone is concerned about me .

345
00:33:00,545 --> 00:33:03,275
So , how 's the weather , is it nice out ?

346
00:33:03,381 --> 00:33:05,576
Yes .

347
00:33:05,683 --> 00:33:07,082
It 's a beautiful day .

348
00:33:07,185 --> 00:33:10,382
You 'll come and see me often , right ?

349
00:33:10,488 --> 00:33:11,955
Okay , see you later .

350
00:33:12,056 --> 00:33:14,547
Goodbye , young man .

351
00:34:48,886 --> 00:34:51,150
Is somebody there ?

352
00:39:17,988 --> 00:39:21,754
My colors .

353
00:39:21,859 --> 00:39:23,986
they are mine .

354
00:39:24,095 --> 00:39:26,029
Let them run in my veins ...

355
00:39:26,130 --> 00:39:29,827
they are soft , soft .

356
00:39:29,934 --> 00:39:35,201
they are soft like Fall ...

357
00:39:35,306 --> 00:39:39,265
Hot like fresh blood ...

358
00:39:39,377 --> 00:39:43,677
the liquid flows down my arms ...

359
00:39:43,781 --> 00:39:48,480
My colors , they transcend me into darkness ...

360
00:39:48,586 --> 00:39:51,054
My colors take me into the yellow decay ...

361
00:39:51,155 --> 00:39:54,249
My colors ... they flow through my veins ...

362
00:39:54,358 --> 00:39:56,485
My colors in my veins ...

363
00:39:56,594 --> 00:39:58,289
creating a brutal nobility ...

364
00:39:58,396 --> 00:40:00,864
Oh God ... my God ...

365
00:40:00,965 --> 00:40:02,455
my colors will paint death clearly ...

366
00:40:02,566 --> 00:40:05,763
Death , Purity , Death .

367
00:40:05,870 --> 00:40:08,566
Purification , holding me ... at their mercy .

368
00:40:08,672 --> 00:40:10,105
My colors .

369
00:40:10,207 --> 00:40:11,196
... dripping from their eyes .

370
00:40:11,308 --> 00:40:12,775
Purity ...

371
00:40:12,877 --> 00:40:15,072
Purity of death .

372
00:40:15,179 --> 00:40:15,770
My colors ...

373
00:40:15,880 --> 00:40:17,370
All my colors .

374
00:40:17,481 --> 00:40:19,142
Purification , it flows in my veins .

375
00:40:19,250 --> 00:40:25,155
Soft , hot , blood , death , the colors , the purity ,

376
00:40:33,264 --> 00:40:41,171
they purify death through my veins . I am dying , I feel it !

377
00:41:29,220 --> 00:41:31,552
Open up !

378
00:41:33,324 --> 00:41:35,485
Open up !

379
00:42:03,721 --> 00:42:06,383
Open up !

380
00:42:06,490 --> 00:42:08,981
Is anyone home ?

381
00:42:45,029 --> 00:42:47,020
Yes ?

382
00:42:47,131 --> 00:42:50,931
Excuse me , I need to see the woman who lives here .

383
00:42:51,035 --> 00:42:52,730
She 's no longer here .

384
00:42:52,836 --> 00:42:55,100
Do you know what time it is ?

385
00:42:55,205 --> 00:42:56,695
Excuse me .

386
00:42:56,807 --> 00:43:00,470
She left three days ago , I 'm her replacement at school .

387
00:43:00,578 --> 00:43:02,978
Come in , now that I 'm awake ...

388
00:43:03,080 --> 00:43:05,742
Won 't you come in ?

389
00:43:05,849 --> 00:43:08,443
I 'm sorry but I was sleeping , excuse the way I look .

390
00:43:08,552 --> 00:43:11,146
Please , please , do come in .

391
00:43:11,255 --> 00:43:13,985
Earlier I dreamt of being at the restaurant .

392
00:43:14,091 --> 00:43:16,059
I was being served a huge portion of escargots .

393
00:43:21,198 --> 00:43:23,428
Do you like them ?

394
00:43:23,534 --> 00:43:26,662
I didn 't have the heart to kill them .

395
00:43:29,974 --> 00:43:31,908
Interested ?

396
00:43:33,310 --> 00:43:39,840
No , I don 't think I could eat them anyway .

397
00:43:39,950 --> 00:43:42,510
What 's your name ?

398
00:43:42,620 --> 00:43:45,214
Francesca .

399
00:43:46,790 --> 00:43:49,691
Well , I 'm going back to bed .

400
00:43:49,793 --> 00:43:52,591
I hope we see each other again .

401
00:45:12,910 --> 00:45:16,812
Hey ! I put a live animal in your friend 's coffin

402
00:45:16,914 --> 00:45:20,281
to keep him company .

403
00:45:40,671 --> 00:45:43,731
Sir , I 'm concerned about the two women in the painting .

404
00:45:43,841 --> 00:45:46,401
The killers of Saint Sebastian seem to be enjoying it .

405
00:45:46,510 --> 00:45:50,207
Perhaps , too much , what do you think ?

406
00:45:50,314 --> 00:45:52,111
I think we have the wrong idea .

407
00:45:52,216 --> 00:45:54,013
The painter did not have the intention of depicting

408
00:45:54,118 --> 00:45:56,484
the agony of the saint .

409
00:45:56,587 --> 00:45:59,715
Everybody says the artist is a sensitive genius

410
00:45:59,823 --> 00:46:03,190
but all he does is paint death ...

411
00:46:03,293 --> 00:46:05,318
of a human without compassion .

412
00:46:05,629 --> 00:46:08,826
Fishing is good around here , the fish are very hungry .

413
00:46:08,932 --> 00:46:10,797
Have you noticed much change here over they ears ?

414
00:46:10,901 --> 00:46:12,994
The village suffered after the war .

415
00:46:13,103 --> 00:46:18,336
Everybody worked and rebuilt with courage and hope .

416
00:46:18,442 --> 00:46:21,377
Tell me about the woman living at the house where I 'm staying .

417
00:46:21,478 --> 00:46:23,343
The paralyzed woman ?

418
00:46:23,447 --> 00:46:24,539
Yes .

419
00:46:24,648 --> 00:46:26,912
I don 't see her much .

420
00:46:27,017 --> 00:46:30,919
She 's the type who doesn 't invite me to her house .

421
00:46:31,021 --> 00:46:33,353
She hasn 't left her bed in years .

422
00:46:33,457 --> 00:46:36,893
People say she has a venereal disease .

423
00:46:36,994 --> 00:46:39,588
But I wouldn 't know .

424
00:46:39,696 --> 00:46:41,323
She doesn 't go to confession .

425
00:46:41,431 --> 00:46:44,161
Was she friends with Legnani ?

426
00:46:44,268 --> 00:46:48,637
Please don 't ruin my day with this kind of talk .

427
00:46:48,739 --> 00:46:50,900
This kind of talk is even scaring away the fish .

428
00:46:51,008 --> 00:46:53,135
Come on , let 's fish .

429
00:47:21,538 --> 00:47:26,635
My colors .

430
00:47:27,678 --> 00:47:29,373
Let them run in my veins

431
00:47:29,479 --> 00:47:31,106


432
00:47:31,215 --> 00:47:32,341
they are soft ...

433
00:47:32,449 --> 00:47:33,416
soft. they are soft like Fall

434
00:47:33,517 --> 00:47:35,644


435
00:47:35,752 --> 00:47:37,583
Hot like fresh blood ...

436
00:47:37,688 --> 00:47:39,087
the liquid flows down my arms . ...

437
00:47:39,189 --> 00:47:42,249
My colors ...

438
00:47:42,359 --> 00:47:43,553
they transcend me into darkness

439
00:47:43,660 --> 00:47:44,649


440
00:47:44,761 --> 00:47:46,126
Colors .

441
00:47:46,230 --> 00:47:47,492
Purity .

442
00:47:47,598 --> 00:47:48,496
Death . Purification , holding me

443
00:47:48,599 --> 00:47:50,123


444
00:47:50,234 --> 00:47:52,327
At their mercy .

445
00:47:52,436 --> 00:47:54,028
My colors . Yellow .

446
00:47:54,137 --> 00:47:56,230
I 'm dying !

447
00:47:56,340 --> 00:47:57,568
My colors ...

448
00:47:57,674 --> 00:47:59,699
blood ... in their eyes ...

449
00:47:59,810 --> 00:48:02,711
Purity ...

450
00:48:02,813 --> 00:48:04,337
What is this mumbo jumbo ?

451
00:48:04,448 --> 00:48:05,745
I didn 't think you 'd come back .

452
00:48:05,849 --> 00:48:07,510
I came anyway .

453
00:48:07,618 --> 00:48:12,146
I was waiting for you .

454
00:48:12,256 --> 00:48:13,951
I 've been here for two hours .

455
00:48:14,057 --> 00:48:15,547
Curiosity made me play it , who is the man talking ?

456
00:48:15,659 --> 00:48:16,921
I don 't know .

457
00:48:17,027 --> 00:48:18,085
I 'm trying to find out .

458
00:48:20,731 --> 00:48:23,256
Why do you live here ?

459
00:48:23,367 --> 00:48:27,235
The priest suggested it .

460
00:48:30,374 --> 00:48:31,773
Are you alone here ?

461
00:48:31,875 --> 00:48:33,809
No , there 's an elderly woman upstairs .

462
00:48:33,911 --> 00:48:36,106
She 's nailed to bed .

463
00:48:41,718 --> 00:48:45,119
I can 't stop smoking , it calms me down .

464
00:48:45,222 --> 00:48:47,315
Do you still want a cooking lesson ?

465
00:48:47,424 --> 00:48:48,516
Escargots ?

466
00:48:48,625 --> 00:48:50,058
No , something much better .

467
00:48:50,160 --> 00:48:51,422
Come .

468
00:48:55,198 --> 00:48:56,392
Do you know how to set a table ?

469
00:48:56,500 --> 00:48:57,592
Yeah .

470
00:48:57,701 --> 00:48:59,396
You 'll find everything you need in this drawer

471
00:48:59,503 --> 00:49:02,267
and while you 're doing that , I 'll be in the kitchen .

472
00:49:02,372 --> 00:49:03,669
Good .

473
00:49:03,774 --> 00:49:05,537
I found a book in the old lady 's library ,

474
00:49:05,642 --> 00:49:08,736
" Cooking For Romance . "

475
00:49:12,349 --> 00:49:15,944
What did you think of the teacher I replaced ?

476
00:49:16,053 --> 00:49:17,281
Did you like her ?

477
00:49:17,387 --> 00:49:20,515
Pardon ? Do you have a lighter ?

478
00:49:20,624 --> 00:49:23,092
Right there .

479
00:49:23,994 --> 00:49:26,394
Did you make love with her ?

480
00:49:26,496 --> 00:49:29,021
Your silence proves you did .

481
00:49:29,132 --> 00:49:30,827
We stopped .

482
00:49:45,015 --> 00:49:46,846
B. L. ?

483
00:49:46,950 --> 00:49:50,215
Whose lighter is this ?

484
00:49:50,320 --> 00:49:52,345
Do you know a painter named Legnani ?

485
00:49:52,456 --> 00:49:55,050
No , it was a gift .

486
00:49:55,158 --> 00:49:57,490
It 's a friend 's lighter .

487
00:50:03,033 --> 00:50:05,228
The gloomy darkness is romantic .

488
00:50:05,335 --> 00:50:07,530
Right ?

489
00:51:02,659 --> 00:51:05,958
While eating this plate the lady and her knight

490
00:51:06,063 --> 00:51:11,399
will feel love overpowering their souls .

491
00:51:11,501 --> 00:51:13,992
Desire is strong .

492
00:53:23,133 --> 00:53:25,897
Do you have a lot of luggage ?

493
00:53:26,002 --> 00:53:28,061
One suitcase .

494
00:53:28,171 --> 00:53:30,696
You could bring it over here .

495
00:54:47,517 --> 00:54:50,782
Hey , what are you doing there ?

496
00:54:54,324 --> 00:54:56,884
I s there where Legnani lived ?

497
00:54:56,993 --> 00:54:58,153
Who ?

498
00:54:58,261 --> 00:55:00,661
The painter , he did the painting at your church .

499
00:55:00,764 --> 00:55:03,665
Can you drive me home ?

500
00:55:03,767 --> 00:55:07,635
Yeah , hurry up .

501
00:55:07,737 --> 00:55:10,001
Go ahead , sit in the front .

502
00:55:18,982 --> 00:55:20,313
Must you go directly home ?

503
00:55:20,417 --> 00:55:22,146
Would you like to get a drink ?

504
00:55:22,252 --> 00:55:24,220
No , they won 't serve me .

505
00:55:24,321 --> 00:55:27,654
they think I should be drinking fruit juice .

506
00:55:27,757 --> 00:55:30,351
Like I can 't handle liquor !

507
00:55:54,250 --> 00:55:55,808
Thank you .

508
00:55:55,919 --> 00:55:57,511
The next one 's on me .

509
00:55:57,620 --> 00:55:59,053
Yeah , if you want , but not today .

510
00:55:59,155 --> 00:56:00,349
Why not ?

511
00:56:00,457 --> 00:56:01,788
J ust tell me about Legnani . Right now ?

512
00:56:01,891 --> 00:56:04,086
Yeah .

513
00:56:04,194 --> 00:56:09,655
The painter ... he went to Brazil .

514
00:56:09,766 --> 00:56:11,427
He went with his mom and two sisters

515
00:56:11,534 --> 00:56:13,331
to find their fortune .

516
00:56:13,436 --> 00:56:16,200
When they returned they were apparently wealthier

517
00:56:16,306 --> 00:56:20,470
than before they left but mother died there .

518
00:56:20,577 --> 00:56:24,445
they came back and built that little house .

519
00:56:29,052 --> 00:56:30,485
Excuse me .

520
00:56:41,331 --> 00:56:42,764
How did they live ?

521
00:56:42,866 --> 00:56:46,666
What ? How did they live ?

522
00:56:46,770 --> 00:56:49,000
He was poor .

523
00:56:49,105 --> 00:56:51,232
He borrowed from everyone .

524
00:56:55,345 --> 00:57:00,681
Even though they had a fortune , he had nothing .

525
00:57:00,784 --> 00:57:08,555
His sisters controlled the money .

526
00:57:08,658 --> 00:57:14,563
You know , I knew him . I was only seven .

527
00:57:14,664 --> 00:57:17,827
She was dying , my mom was sick .

528
00:57:17,934 --> 00:57:21,392
He came to draw her .

529
00:57:33,216 --> 00:57:36,117
We called him the Painter of Agony .

530
00:57:36,219 --> 00:57:42,215
He liked to paint people who were dying .

531
00:57:42,325 --> 00:57:45,783
He wasn 't that crazy .

532
00:57:45,895 --> 00:57:50,423
His sisters were devils .

533
00:57:50,533 --> 00:57:53,730
By painting death he was trying to control nature ,

534
00:57:53,837 --> 00:57:55,566
to confront death .

535
00:57:55,672 --> 00:57:57,833
He was obsessed with death .

536
00:57:57,941 --> 00:58:01,672
And the dying .

537
00:58:01,778 --> 00:58:06,408
Could you recognize the sound of his voice ?

538
00:58:06,516 --> 00:58:08,609
Could you recognize it ?

539
00:58:13,556 --> 00:58:16,525
It 's the kind of voice you don 't forget .

540
00:58:16,626 --> 00:58:18,787
He talked like a psycho !

541
00:58:18,895 --> 00:58:21,887
Like a machine gun .

542
00:58:24,601 --> 00:58:29,038
Then suddenly he would stop and start chanting .

543
00:58:29,138 --> 00:58:31,971
Psycho !

544
00:58:34,677 --> 00:58:37,237
He was really crazy because of his sisters .

545
00:58:37,347 --> 00:58:38,371
Plug it in quick .

546
00:58:38,481 --> 00:58:40,415
Yeah .

547
00:58:40,517 --> 00:58:42,542
Okay , listen to this .

